DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
19307::$$$message_0150_0000_0000$$$::                     This will be the last fragment I experience on this earth.::
19308::$$$message_0150_0001_0000$$$::Avenger said to reach the Cup of Heaven[line len=2][lr]::
19309::$$$message_0150_0001_0001$$$::Heaven's Feel, the Third Magic. Hidden treasure of the Einzberns.[lr]::
19310::$$$message_0150_0001_0002$$$::It's her title, and she should know how this entire situation has worked all along.::
19311::$$$message_0150_0002_0000$$$::I pass through the long corridor and arrive in the courtyard.[lr]::
19312::$$$message_0150_0002_0001$$$::The sky is always cloudy over the castle.[lr]::
19313::$$$message_0150_0002_0002$$$::No mere chalice has managed to breach this fort, which is governed by the true Holy Grail.::
19314::$$$message_0150_0003_0000$$$::"Illyasviel."[lr]::
19315::$$$message_0150_0003_0001$$$::I call to her.[lr]::
19316::$$$message_0150_0003_0002$$$::Right now, I lack emotion. It has given way to unease and resignation.[lr]::
19317::$$$message_0150_0003_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
19318::$$$message_0150_0003_0004$$$::She doesn't answer.[lr]::
19319::$$$message_0150_0003_0005$$$::I step slightly closer to her.::
19320::$$$message_0150_0004_0000$$$::"It's all right. I can hear you, so stay there.[lr]::
19321::$$$message_0150_0004_0001$$$::Hello, Shirou. Did you come all this way just to see me?"[lr]::
19322::$$$message_0150_0004_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
19323::$$$message_0150_0004_0003$$$::I stop.[lr]::
19324::$$$message_0150_0004_0004$$$::It seems this conversation will proceed quickly.::
19325::$$$message_0150_0005_0000$$$::"Yeah. I have some minor business to discuss. I wanted to ask a few questions."::
19326::$$$message_0150_0006_0000$$$::"It's unusual of you to come asking me.[lr]::
19327::$$$message_0150_0006_0001$$$::What kind of questions? I'd prefer to keep it lighthearted.[lr]::
19328::$$$message_0150_0006_0002$$$::This is a party, after all. It would be a waste not to enjoy it."[lr]::
19329::$$$message_0150_0006_0003$$$::"I agree.[lr]::
19330::$$$message_0150_0006_0004$$$::So you knew all along, Illya?"::
19331::$$$message_0150_0007_0000$$$::"More or less. But it would all stop if you found out, so I was hoping you wouldn't come here.[lr]::
19332::$$$message_0150_0007_0001$$$::I'd like to keep this going as long as possible."::
19333::$$$message_0150_0008_0000$$$::...Yeah.[lr]::
19334::$$$message_0150_0008_0001$$$::That's why she's been so against me coming anywhere near the castle.[lr]::
19335::$$$message_0150_0008_0002$$$::It was Illya's way of fighting back.::
19336::$$$message_0150_0009_0000$$$::"...I think you let yourself get carried away with your hobbies, though."[lr]::
19337::$$$message_0150_0009_0001$$$::"Heh heh. I knew you'd show up eventually, so I decided to make all of it fun."::
19338::$$$message_0150_0010_0000$$$::"All of it"?[lr]::
19339::$$$message_0150_0010_0001$$$::She played along, knowing what was happening the entire time,[lr]::
19340::$$$message_0150_0010_0002$$$::waiting in this castle and not blaming or trying to defeat the cause.::
19341::$$$message_0150_0011_0000$$$::"Illya. What is the Cup of Heaven? Is it the Holy Grail that's recreating the war?"[lr]::
19342::$$$message_0150_0011_0001$$$::"So impatient. Jumping to the point already?[lr]::
19343::$$$message_0150_0011_0002$$$::You [font italic=true]have[font italic=false] been kept in suspense for a long time, though. I'll overlook your rudeness."::
19344::$$$message_0150_0012_0000$$$::"All right. The Holy Grail that was the prize of the Holy Grail War in Fuyuki was just a vortex of magical energy that people called a Holy Grail.[lr]::
19345::$$$message_0150_0012_0001$$$::It was an enormous amount of power that could grant its owner's wishes, broadly speaking."::
19346::$$$message_0150_0013_0000$$$::"But the Holy Grail this time is different.[lr]::
19347::$$$message_0150_0013_0001$$$::It isn't strong at all, but it's a tiny, genuine Holy Grail that's trying to grant its bearer's wish however it can."::
19348::$$$message_0150_0014_0000$$$::"Needless to say, it's actually a Servant![lr]::
19349::$$$message_0150_0014_0001$$$::It was a certain someone who was summoned in the Third Holy Grail War, got absorbed into the Holy Grail, and grew using the Grail's power into a demon who grants human wishes!"::
19350::$$$message_0150_0015_0000$$$::A demon who grants human wishes? That sounds misleading.[lr]::
19351::$$$message_0150_0015_0001$$$::It would be more accurate to call him a "a demon whom humans wished for."::
19352::$$$message_0150_0016_0000$$$::"But I won't say the demon's name.[lr]::
19353::$$$message_0150_0016_0001$$$::The Cup of Heaven is like that demon's contract.[lr]::
19354::$$$message_0150_0016_0002$$$::It's the place where it all began, and it's also probably where the demon's precious contractor is at."::
19355::$$$message_0150_0017_0000$$$::"And the Holy Grail is there? Where?"[lr]::
19356::$$$message_0150_0017_0001$$$::"The highest place in this city. Someone who wasn't in the Fifth Holy Grail War fell from that place to the earth.[lr]::
19357::$$$message_0150_0017_0002$$$::It's all backwards. We've gone from Heaven's Feel to Heaven's Fall."::
19358::$$$message_0150_0018_0000$$$::The highest place in this city.[lr]::
19359::$$$message_0150_0018_0001$$$::That isn't the Center Building. It's...::
19360::$$$message_0150_0019_0000$$$::"That's insane. How would you even get up there?"[lr]::
19361::$$$message_0150_0019_0001$$$::"Huh? Ah, right. You normally can't reach it.[lr]::
19362::$$$message_0150_0019_0002$$$::...Oh, well.[lr]::
19363::$$$message_0150_0019_0003$$$::Hey, Shirou. What do you think of this Holy Grail War?"::
19364::$$$message_0150_0020_0000$$$::"Nothing at all.[lr]::
19365::$$$message_0150_0020_0001$$$::It's made-up. These four days are fake."[lr]::
19366::$$$message_0150_0020_0002$$$::"And once the four days are over? Will everyone disappear?"[lr]::
19367::$$$message_0150_0020_0003$$$::"Ah... No, uh..."::
19368::$$$message_0150_0021_0000$$$::They won't disappear,[lr]::
19369::$$$message_0150_0021_0001$$$::but everything that occurred during the four days will.[lr]::
19370::$$$message_0150_0021_0002$$$::After all, they're illusions that happened in an artificial world.[lr]::
19371::$$$message_0150_0021_0003$$$::It won't leave a trace in anyone's memories.::
19372::$$$message_0150_0022_0000$$$::"Exactly.[lr]::
19373::$$$message_0150_0022_0001$$$::You called it a made-up world, but that's actually not true. The stage is fake, but the people standing on it are real.[lr]::
19374::$$$message_0150_0022_0002$$$::Take Rin, for example. Even if her role changes, she's definitely still Rin, no matter what she does."::
19375::$$$message_0150_0023_0000$$$::"There's only one made-up, fake person in this world.[lr]::
19376::$$$message_0150_0023_0001$$$::That person is wearing the shell of someone else in this town and reenacting the Holy Grail War in this world.[lr]::
19377::$$$message_0150_0023_0002$$$::He's experiencing a Fifth Holy Grail War he doesn't know, in order to continue the Holy Grail War as his contractor wishes."::
19378::$$$message_0150_0024_0000$$$::...She's right.[lr]::
19379::$$$message_0150_0024_0001$$$::That's why this earth and the Cup of Heaven don't overlap.[lr]::
19380::$$$message_0150_0024_0002$$$::She's using the script of the Third Holy Grail War with the participants in the Fifth to keep fighting.[lr]::
19381::$$$message_0150_0024_0003$$$::But sometimes, the fake makes a big mistake, and the third and fifth wars are intermingled.[lr]::
19382::$$$message_0150_0024_0004$$$::The two wars aren't linked. Her war and our war have always been separate.::
19383::$$$message_0150_0025_0000$$$::"Once the fourth day ends, everyone goes back to the way they were before.[lr]::
19384::$$$message_0150_0025_0001$$$::All things return from whence they came.[lr]::
19385::$$$message_0150_0025_0002$$$::It's as if the four days never happened."::
19386::$$$message_0150_0026_0000$$$::"But that one person disappears along with the four days.[lr]::
19387::$$$message_0150_0026_0001$$$::He can't go on to the fifth day in the real world.[lr]::
19388::$$$message_0150_0026_0002$$$::He won't even remain in the world's memories, just like the name he was stripped of."::
19389::$$$message_0150_0027_0000$$$::That sounds about right.[lr]::
19390::$$$message_0150_0027_0001$$$::He never existed in this city, after all.::
19391::$$$message_0150_0028_0000$$$::"Still, though.[lr]::
19392::$$$message_0150_0028_0001$$$::If there's a fake, then there has to be a real original.[lr]::
19393::$$$message_0150_0028_0002$$$::What happens to that?"[lr]::
19394::$$$message_0150_0028_0003$$$::"It switches with the fake, as if that's how they always have been."::
19395::$$$message_0150_0029_0000$$$::I see.[lr]::
19396::$$$message_0150_0029_0001$$$::After the fake disappears, the real one remains, scraped clean of impurities.::
19397::$$$message_0150_0030_0000$$$::"I see. But then...[lr]::
19398::$$$message_0150_0030_0001$$$::I know this sounds oblique, but the fake really is fake, then.[lr]::
19399::$$$message_0150_0030_0002$$$::No matter how similar he is to the original, as long as he isn't the original, his actions..."::
19400::$$$message_0150_0031_0000$$$::"No. He's fake, but he's undoubtedly real.[lr]::
19401::$$$message_0150_0031_0001$$$::He isn't a reproduction or the same being.[lr]::
19402::$$$message_0150_0031_0002$$$::He becomes the real one, for these four days only."::
19403::$$$message_0150_0032_0000$$$::...I don't quite understand.[lr]::
19404::$$$message_0150_0032_0001$$$::It's not the theory I'm uncertain of, but the meaning behind this girl's smile.[lr]::
19405::$$$message_0150_0032_0002$$$::It's just that...her smile is enough to...::
19406::$$$message_0150_0033_0000$$$::"...Okay.[lr]::
19407::$$$message_0150_0033_0001$$$::Then does that mean his actions were natural?"[lr]::
19408::$$$message_0150_0033_0002$$$::I breathe a sigh of resigned relief.::
19409::$$$message_0150_0034_0000$$$::"Yes. I said he was wearing a shell, but he never had a shape to begin with.[lr]::
19410::$$$message_0150_0034_0001$$$::Nothingness can't become anyone, nor can it imitate anything.[lr]::
19411::$$$message_0150_0034_0002$$$::That's why...no matter whose body he shapes himself into, he'll never be anything but nothing."::
19412::$$$message_0150_0035_0000$$$::"Even if he possesses...no, assimilates with someone, he will never affect his host.[lr]::
19413::$$$message_0150_0035_0001$$$::That's why he's fake, but his actions[lr]::
19414::$$$message_0150_0035_0002$$$::are real, without a doubt."::
19415::$$$message_0150_0036_0000$$$::That's a load off my back.[lr]::
19416::$$$message_0150_0036_0001$$$::This is all made-up, but everything that's happened was real.[lr]::
19417::$$$message_0150_0036_0002$$$::But somehow...::
19418::$$$message_0150_0037_0000$$$::"...But it sounds like he has a will of his own."[lr]::
19419::$$$message_0150_0037_0001$$$::"...That isn't the will of the nothingness.[lr]::
19420::$$$message_0150_0037_0002$$$::When he assimilated into a form with a will of its own, he began confusing it with his own will."::
19421::$$$message_0150_0038_0000$$$::The pieces are falling into place.[lr]::
19422::$$$message_0150_0038_0001$$$::Metaphorically speaking, he became only able to think like the busybody whose shell he put on.[lr]::
19423::$$$message_0150_0038_0002$$$::The Servant Avenger hasn't split off from All the Evil in the World.[lr]::
19424::$$$message_0150_0038_0003$$$::Avenger's personality is made-up, shaped by the human possessed by nothingness as a sample.::
19425::$$$message_0150_0039_0000$$$::"Then, he..."[lr]::
19426::$$$message_0150_0039_0001$$$::He wasn't even fake.[lr]::
19427::$$$message_0150_0039_0002$$$::He just never existed.::
19428::$$$message_0150_0040_0000$$$::"...No. I'll concede this much: [lr]::
19429::$$$message_0150_0040_0001$$$::You are you, Aŋra Mainiiu. You might forget this right away, but I'll remember until the very end...[lr]::
19430::$$$message_0150_0040_0002$$$::...that you tried to end this wish out of your own will."::
19431::$$$message_0150_0041_0000$$$::It's poetic justice, maybe.[lr]::
19432::$$$message_0150_0041_0001$$$::A descendant of the person who summoned me is trying to set me free right now.::
19433::$$$message_0150_0042_0000$$$::"This is a world where all outcomes are present.[lr]::
19434::$$$message_0150_0042_0001$$$::No matter how perfect a sandbox it is, you'll eventually learn everything there is to know about it."::
19435::$$$message_0150_0043_0000$$$::"Its collapse is imminent.[lr]::
19436::$$$message_0150_0043_0001$$$::If you want to continue, then you can't take any action.[lr]::
19437::$$$message_0150_0043_0002$$$::You'll have to repeat the bare minimum of daily life scenes and leave something undiscovered, or this world will wane.[lr]::
19438::$$$message_0150_0043_0003$$$::The future exists. That fact is what kept this world turning.[lr]::
19439::$$$message_0150_0043_0004$$$::But you two couldn't make it happen."::
19440::$$$message_0150_0044_0000$$$::"..."[rf][lr]::
19441::$$$message_0150_0044_0001$$$::She's right.[lr]::
19442::$$$message_0150_0044_0002$$$::But the two of us couldn't do it.[lr]::
19443::$$$message_0150_0044_0003$$$::The real one who sought better results from inborn, twisted nature.[lr]::
19444::$$$message_0150_0044_0004$$$::The fake one who wanted to find something new, just because it was fun.[lr]::
19445::$$$message_0150_0044_0005$$$::That's who the protagonist of this sandbox is.::
19446::$$$message_0150_0045_0000$$$::"Aahh..."[rf][lr]::
19447::$$$message_0150_0045_0001$$$::"This is all I can do for you. You've always been an observer, and now you're recognized as human.[lr]::
19448::$$$message_0150_0045_0002$$$::The rest is simple. I'll remember, even if you don't.[lr]::
19449::$$$message_0150_0045_0003$$$::You're going to climb up to that moon."[lr]::
19450::$$$message_0150_0045_0004$$$::"...[font color=0x666666]I'm [font color=0x777777]fi[font color=0x888888]na[font color=0x999999]ll[font color=0xaaaaaa]y [font color=0xbbbbbb]h[font color=0xcccccc]e[font color=0xdddddd]r[font color=0xeeeeee]e, [font color=0xffffff]then."[rf]::
19451::$$$message_0150_0046_0000$$$::It's as Illyasviel says.[lr]::
19452::$$$message_0150_0046_0001$$$::No tools can help me reach the moon.[lr]::
19453::$$$message_0150_0046_0002$$$::Only Avenger's main body and his contractor Bazett can ascend to the Holy Grail, since they're already there.::
19454::$$$message_0150_0047_0000$$$::Everything's already finished.[lr]::
19455::$$$message_0150_0047_0001$$$::I begin to leave before my heat returns.::
19456::$$$message_0150_0048_0000$$$::"Was it fun?"[lr]::
19457::$$$message_0150_0048_0001$$$::"Yeah. Thanks, Illya."[lr]::
19458::$$$message_0150_0048_0002$$$::I thank her not for her help now, but for letting me enjoy this when she knew about it all along.::
19459::$$$message_0150_0049_0000$$$::"You're welcome.[lr]::
19460::$$$message_0150_0049_0001$$$::It's a fire sale on miracles after all. I had to do you this favor, at least."[lr]::
19461::$$$message_0150_0049_0002$$$::Her smile is warm and genuine.[lr]::
19462::$$$message_0150_0049_0003$$$::Its brightness overtakes pleasure, for me.::
19463::$$$message_0150_0050_0000$$$::"Hey. Is it about to end?"[lr]::
19464::$$$message_0150_0050_0001$$$::I look away.[lr]::
19465::$$$message_0150_0050_0002$$$::"Yeah. It's lost another bit of its brilliance."[lr]::
19466::$$$message_0150_0050_0003$$$::Suddenly, something warm engulfs me.[lr]::
19467::$$$message_0150_0050_0004$$$::By the time I realize it's her body heat...[lr]::
19468::$$$message_0150_0050_0005$$$::"You're so strong-willed. It's okay to cry at least once, you know."[lr]::
19469::$$$message_0150_0050_0006$$$::She melts the emotions I went to so much trouble to chill.::
19470::$$$message_0150_0051_0000$$$::"...But why? There's nothing to cry about.[lr]::
19471::$$$message_0150_0051_0001$$$::The days will go on. Nothing will be lost."[lr]::
19472::$$$message_0150_0051_0002$$$::Nothingness will return to nothingness, that's all.[lr]::
19473::$$$message_0150_0051_0003$$$::The books are balanced.::
19474::$$$message_0150_0052_0000$$$::I leave the courtyard.[lr]::
19475::$$$message_0150_0052_0001$$$::And then...[lr]::
19476::$$$message_0150_0052_0002$$$::"Ah... Tch."[lr]::
19477::$$$message_0150_0052_0003$$$::I feel dizzy, and just slightly, my memories of before and after become vague.::
19478::$$$message_0150_0053_0000$$$::"Thanks. Come play again, Shirou."[lr]::
19479::$$$message_0150_0053_0001$$$::Illya doesn't wave. She bids me a gentle farewell.[lr]::
19480::$$$message_0150_0053_0002$$$::Bewildered by my foggy memories, I wave my hand goodbye.[lr]::
19481::$$$message_0150_0053_0003$$$::...I can't quite remember what we talked about, but our parting was beautiful.::
19482::$$$message_0150_0054_0000$$$::I mean, Illya was smiling so much.[lr]::
19483::$$$message_0150_0054_0001$$$::It had to have been a happy time for her.::
919326::$$$message_9150_0006_0000$$$::"It's unusual of you to come asking me."[r]::

